msgctxt "#31737"
msgid "Uses the skin's own libraryart folder by default. Custom covers must match library names."
msgstr "Uses the skin's own libraryart folder by default. Custom covers must match library names."

msgctxt "#31738"
msgid "Show resolution, audio and subtitle badges in media info. On by default."
msgstr "Show resolution, audio and subtitle badges in media info. On by default."

msgctxt "#31739"
msgid "Shows your own rating by default. Pick Rating for source ratings, or None to hide."
msgstr "Shows your own rating by default. Pick Rating for source ratings, or None to hide."

msgctxt "#31740"
msgid "A picked source is shown as-is; with Auto, the item's rating type decides: Kodi-scraped items carry TMDb/IMDb types, while Emby items are typed by the add-on (usually IMDb). Pick Douban when the helper add-on's Douban override is on."
msgstr "A picked source is shown as-is; with Auto, the item's rating type decides: Kodi-scraped items carry TMDb/IMDb types, while Emby items are typed by the add-on (usually IMDb). Pick Douban when the helper add-on's Douban override is on."

msgctxt "#31741"
msgid "Follows the language setting by default. Or show the original title only, or both."
msgstr "Follows the language setting by default. Or show the original title only, or both."

